  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "While calibrating, the T-posed avatar has a good deal of dampening to the position/rotation of the head.\nIf you have recently turned and calibrate too quickly before the dampening catches up, you will calibrate at the wrong angle/position.\nUnless there is some other reason for this dampening I think it should be removed for more accurate calibration.",
